| Token | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Height | 56px |
| Radius | 16px |
| Width | 100% (full CTAs) |
| Typography | inherits Profile (16px body) |

## Applies to

Add Address · Add Business Address · Save Address · Save Changes · Continue · Verify Account · Verify Business Account · Confirm · Submit · Complete Verification · all future primary CTAs

## Forbidden

Blue / black / grey buttons · different gradients · different radius/heights · second primary system

## Golden rule

ONE PRODUCT · ONE BUTTON SYSTEM · ONE PRIMARY COLOUR · ONE DESIGN SYSTEM  
ONLY CONTENT MAY DIFFER. DESIGN NEVER DOES.

## Cursor must never

- Invent a second primary CTA colour for My Account
- Use blue/black/grey for primary CTAs on Addresses / Verification / etc.
- Change height/radius away from 56 / 16 without Owner approval
